        "source_sentence": "The reactive polymer $\\mathbf { P S B } \\mathbf { B r } _ { 2 }$was then treated in situ with a slight excess of 1-trimethylstannyl-4-tert-butylbenzene at $- 2 0 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$in $\\mathrm { C H } _ { 2 } \\mathrm { C l } _ { 2 } .$Under these conditions, selective replacement of only one of the boron-bound bromine substituents by the tert-butylphenyl group led to the formation of PSBPhBr"
