        "source_sentence": "we synthesized a random copolymer, $\\mathbf { P S B P h Q - H - } c o \\mathbf { - } \\mathbf { P S S i M e } _ { 3 } ,$with only 10% boron functionalization. The copolymer was obtained using similar methods as for the homopolymers, except that only 0.1 equiv of BBr<sub>3</sub> were used in the initial Si-B exchange reaction."
